00:43:34,912 --> 00:43:48,032
But but um certainly there are cases where you end up with objects that get chatty with each other and they're sitting on different servers, and the latency of RPC communication between them becomes an issue.

386
00:43:48,206 --> 00:43:51,792
Um, and there's actually a very nice research paper they published about this.

