393
00:44:39,152 --> 00:44:41,312
I mean, it seems like most of the systems work fine.

394
00:44:41,472 --> 00:44:43,632
I guess communication is fast enough.

395
00:44:45,102 --> 00:44:48,196
but we do have technology to make it much better.

